### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Criar cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cliente Demonstração",
  "email": "cliente@example.com",
  "documentNumber": "123.456.789-01"
}

> {% client.global.set("clientId", response.body.id); %}

### Consultar cliente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}

### Criar análise
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/analyses

> {% client.global.set("analysisId", response.body.id); %}

### Consultar análise
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analyses/{{analysisId}}

### Listar análises do cliente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/analyses
